    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "9. A) Parents' talking with them during TV time raises their curiosity levels.\nB) Their daily television exposure cuts parent-child conversation time.\nC) The more TV they watch the poorer their progress in development.\nD) Their socioeconomic levels impact their academic achievement.",
